# ── FLOW: CANCELLATION ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

@Given "^a '([^']*)' trade in Pending Approval status with a Cancellation task is visible in the blotter$"
    Given a Live '$1' trade exists in the blotter
    And maker is logged in to the trade portal
    And perform cancellation for the trade from trade portal
    And the cancellation is submitted successfully

# Product param must match a ProductDatFiles enum name: FX_TRF | FX_PSCRIPT that match a .dat test data file name

@Given "^multiple '([^']*)' trades in Pending Approval status with Cancellation tasks are visible in the blotter$"
    Given multiple '$1' trades with pending cancellation are provisioned via playwright api
    And page trade portal clicks refresh button

# ── MAKER ACTIONS ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

@When "^perform cancellation for the trade from trade portal$"
    When page trade portal searches and opens action menu for trade stored as 'createdTradeId'
    And page trade portal cancellation action button is visible
    And trigger cancellation for trade using configured risk engine mode from trade portal for trade stored as 'createdTradeId'
    And component trade change confirmation dialog is visible
    And component trade change confirmation selects reason option 'DEALER_ERROR'
    And component trade change confirmation types comments as 'cancellation for test'
    And page trade portal confirms trade change and waits for New Today Blotter to reload

@When "^perform cancellation for the trade from trade detail page$"
    When opens trade detail for current trade from trade portal
    And page trade detail clicks more actions button
    And trigger cancellation for trade using configured risk engine mode from trade detail page for trade stored as 'createdTradeId'
    And component trade change confirmation dialog is visible
    And component trade change confirmation selects reason option 'DEALER_ERROR'
    And component trade change confirmation types comments as 'cancellation for test'
    And confirm lifecycle event trade change and wait for page ready

@Then "^the Cancellation option is available for the trade$"
    When page trade portal searches and opens action menu for trade stored as 'createdTradeId'
    And page trade portal row action menu shows view details
    And page trade portal cancellation action button is visible

@Then "^the Cancellation option is not available for the trade$"
    When page trade portal searches and opens action menu for trade stored as 'createdTradeId'
    And page trade portal row action menu shows view details
    And page trade portal cancellation action button is hidden

@Then "^the Approve and Reject option is available for the trade$"
    When page trade portal searches and opens action menu for trade stored as 'createdTradeId'
    And page trade portal approve action button is visible
    And page trade portal reject action button is visible

@Then "^the Approve and Reject option is not available for the trade$"
    When page trade portal searches and opens action menu for trade stored as 'createdTradeId'
    And page trade portal row action menu shows view details
    And page trade portal approve action button is hidden
    And page trade portal reject action button is hidden

@Then "^all selected trades are closed as cancelled in the blotter$"
    Then search for trade stored as 'createdTradeId1' in blotter
    And page trade portal blotter row of trade stored as 'createdTradeId1' shows status 'DEAD' and event status 'Cancelled'
    And search for trade stored as 'createdTradeId2' in blotter
    And page trade portal blotter row of trade stored as 'createdTradeId2' shows status 'DEAD' and event status 'Cancelled'

@Then "^the cancellation is submitted successfully$"
    Then assert toast notification with type 'success' and message 'Cancellation completed successfully'

@Then "^the cancellation request is rejected with an error$"
    Then assert toast notification with type 'error' and message 'Request failed with status code 500'

@Then "^the cancellation request is pending checker approval in trade details$"
    Then page trade detail status badge shows 'PARV'

# After a cancellation from the blotter, which the page reloaded after it.
@Then "^the cancellation request is pending checker approval$"
    Then page trade portal blotter row of trade stored as 'createdTradeId' shows status 'PARV' and event status 'Cancelled'

# After the cancellation is approved from the blotter, which the page reloaded: the row is checked where it is.
@Then "^the trade is closed as Cancelled$"
    Then page trade portal blotter row of trade stored as 'createdTradeId' shows status 'DEAD' and event status 'Cancelled'
